Hash Generation
Performs sign text file generation from input hash text file.

Below is the syntax :
          
vrte_hash 	- metadata vrte_conf_file  
- outputtxt output_hash_file
[-blockarea {HEADER | PAYLOAD}]
[-id tag_id]
[-ranges range_count]  
[-from startaddress]
[-to endarress]  
[-rangeoutput output_hash_for_ranges]

Example:
1.	vrte_hash -id tag1 -outputtxt hash_cli0.txt -ranges 2 -FROM 0x20004000 -to 0x20005000 -FROM 0x20006000 -TO 0x20008000 
2.	vrte_hash -metadata metadata.xml -id tag1 -blockarea header -outputtxt hash_cli.txt 
